# The golden fixtures are compared BYTE FOR BYTE (internal/replay/player_test.go,
# TestGoldenFixtures), and scripts/*.sh run under bash. Git for Windows defaults
# to core.autocrlf=true, so without this a fresh clone -- or the `git checkout .`
# that CLAUDE_CODE_START.md advertises as the undo button -- rewrites both to
# CRLF: all twelve goldens then fail looking exactly like a trace-format change,
# and the shell scripts die on `$'\r': command not found`.
#
# Pinning LF in the working tree costs nothing on Linux, where it is already the
# case, and removes the entire class of failure on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and the text filters must never touch them.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
